  id: katana_crimson
  displayName: Crimson Oath
  description: Quenched in the blood of the oath it swore. Heavier than it looks; it bites deep and slow.
  epithet: Blade of Borrow, the Purified King
  lore: "A boy from a poor village in the east swore it to a broken kingdom, and made the kingdom whole. Then the field of six hundred thousand woke something, and the blade drank the rest of the war for him. It still drinks that way.\n\nThe Ascended's light burned the war out of him. He walked into the Sinking Fields and did not walk out, and no one ever found the body. His hands are still folded over the hilt."
  foundAt: King's Barrow, above the Vale of Graves
  icon: {fileID: 0}
  showcase: {fileID: 21300000, guid: ff701bd5091a49a284af47af24d23f1f, type: 3}
